SUMMARY:B’DAY: 20 Years Later - A Beyoncé Birthday Celebration
DESCRIPTION:B’DAY: 20 Years Later celebrates the 20th anniversary of Beyoncé’s iconic B’Day album on Beyoncé’s actual birthday\, Friday\, September 4\, at The Fruit in Downtown Durham. \nThe night is designed as the ultimate Beyoncé fan experience\, featuring B’Day played front to back with a live band and dancers\, Beyoncé Bingo and prizes\, themed drinks\, a Best Dressed contest and more surprises throughout the night. \nHosted by Mir.I.am and Romell with music by DJ RNB\, B’DAY: 20 Years Later comes from the creators of Hive Hoedown and Renaissance Brunch.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/bday-20-years-later-a-beyonce-birthday-celebration/
LOCATION:The Fruit\, 305 South Dillard St\, Durham\, NC\, 27705\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Engagement,Concert,Conference / Convention,Cultural,Dance,DJ,Festival,Live Performance,Music
