SUMMARY:Fall Film Series in the Park: Zootopia 2
DESCRIPTION:After a fun summer of seeing some amazing local Durham talent perform on stage during the Summer Concert Series\, Durham Parks and Recreation (DPR) is keeping the party going with an extraordinary lineup of movies for their Fall Film Series! \nThe series kicks off on Saturday\, September 5\, with Zootopia 2 (PG)! The 2025 animated film will delight audiences of all ages with the story of Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde\, two new partners in the Zootopia Police Department with clashing personalities. The film stars Ginnifer Goodwin as Judy Hopps and Jason Bateman as Nick Wilde. \nAll movies will be shown at Durham Central Park\, located at 501 Foster Street\, from 7:30-9:30 p.m. DPR will be offering free popcorn and there will be an amazing selection of local food trucks during each event. So get your family and friends together\, grab a chair or blanket\, and enjoy a night of free movies with DPR all fall long!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fall-film-series-in-the-park-zootopia-2/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Cinema/Film/Movies,Free
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Fall-Film-Series-2026.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Durham Parks &amp%3B Recreation":MAILTO:dprinfo@durhamnc.gov
GEO:36.0003991;-78.9018375
